ivate equity","deal_type":"Buyout","value_creation_plan":"Triton is building formicon as a buy-and-build platform in a highly fragmented industry, aiming to develop it into the German market leader covering all service phases of construction projects.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.eqs-news.com/news/corporate/triton-establishes-nationwide-architecture-and-engineering-group-formicon/b6077401-0180-4881-82b6-37b4d680d7c7_en","notes":"Initial group: blfp, IBJ Planungsgesellschaft, enertec and SGP3; later add-ons include SCHUETT, WUP Ingenieure, Bruder Architekten, Ingenieurteam Trebes and Taube + Goerz. Triton portfolio page lists status Current, strategy TSM."}},{"name":"Fiduciary Trust Company","website":"https://www.fiduciary-trust.com/","description":"Fiduciary Trust Company is a Boston-based private wealth manager and trust company providing wealth planning, investment management, trustee and estate, custody, family office and tax services to ultra-high-net-worth individuals, families, nonprofits and institutions, and custody and trustee services to financial advisors and family offices.","sector":"Financial Services","subsector":"Wealth management and trust services","country":"United States","founded_year":1885,"business_model":"B2C and B2B (private wealth management for families and individuals; custody and trustee services for advisors and family offices)","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Doris P. Meister","title":"Executive Chair, President & CEO","source_url":"https://www.fiduciary-trust.com/news/fiduciary-trust-company-appoints-doris-meister-as-chief-executive-officer/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"BOSTON, MA – August 11, 2026 – Fiduciary Trust Company (“Fiduciary”) ... announced today that Executive Chair, Doris Meister has been named President and Chief Executive Officer. Meister succeeds Austin Shapard"},{"role":"cfo","name":"Adam D. Thompson","title":"Chief Financial Officer","source_url":"https://www.fiduciary-trust.com/our-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Adam D. Thompson, CPA | Chief Financial Officer"},{"role":"coo","name":"Puneet Nevatia","title":"Chief Operating Officer","source_url":"https://www.fiduciary-trust.com/our-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Puneet Nevatia | Chief Operating Officer"},{"role":"other","name":"Sidney F. Queler","title":"President of Wealth","source_url":"https://www.fiduciary-trust.com/our-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Sidney F. Queler | President of Wealth"}],"notes":"Approximately $34 billion in total assets as of 2025-09-30 (GTCR release). Austin Shapard, CEO for 12 years, became Senior Advisor in August 2026. Parent is Fiduciary Company Incorporated; subsidiaries Fiduciary Trust Company (Boston) and Fiduciary Trust of New England (New Hampshire-chartered trust company). Revenue, EBITDA and headcount are not disclosed. The contact page prints only a named individual's address, so no generic email is recorded.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/gtcr-announces-acquisition-of-fiduciary-trust-company-302620157.html","name":"GTCR via PR Newswire","kind":"wire","as_of":"2025-11-19","evidence":"Fiduciary is a Boston-based private wealth manager and trust company serving ultra-high net worth individuals, families, and institutions."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.fiduciary-trust.com/about-us/","name":"Fiduciary Trust Company","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Fiduciary Trust Company was founded as a family office in 1885 and incorporated as a trust bank in 1928."},"country":{"url":"https://www.fiduciary-trust.com/contact-us/","name":"Fiduciary Trust Company","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"53 State Street | Boston, MA 02109"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/gtcr-announces-acquisition-of-fiduciary-trust-company-302620157.html","name":"GTCR via PR Newswire","kind":"wire","as_of":"2025-11-19","evidence":"The Company also provides custody and trustee services nationwide to third-party financial advisors and family offices, including access to New Hampshire's advantageous trust laws."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"GTCR","status":"current","status_note":"Acquired by GTCR; closed April 22, 2026 (first institutional capital)","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Buyout","value_creation_plan":"Fiduciary will pursue strategic initiatives including enhancing its investment platform offerings, expanding its breadth of services, further tech-enabling its platform and growing its employee base, with GTCR supporting it with significant capital and expertise.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/gtcr-announces-acquisition-of-fiduciary-trust-company-302620157.html","notes":"Agreement announced 2025-11-19; closing announced 2026-04-22 with former Wilmington Trust CEO Doris Meister joining as Executive Chair under GTCR's Leaders Strategy. Financial terms not disclosed."}},{"name":"Global Elite Group","website":"https://globaleliteinc.com/","description":"Global Elite Group is a leading aviation security services provider supporting airports, airlines, and cargo operators across the United States.","sector":"Business Services","subsector":"Aviation security services","country":"United States","founded_year":2002,"business_model":"B2B (managed-service model for airport authorities and air carriers under long-term contracts)","email":"inquiries@globaleliteinc.com","email_type":"generic","employees":1800,"employees_text":"employs approximately 1,800 personnel","employees_as_of":"2026-04-01","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Victor Anderes","title":"Chief Executive Officer","source_url":"https://hig.com/news/h-i-g-capital-completes-acquisition-of-global-elite-group/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Victor Anderes, Chief Executive Officer of Global Elite Group, said:"}],"notes":"Headquartered at 825 East Gate Boulevard, Garden City, NY. Operates across 19 of the top 20 U.S. airports. Acquired