rman emeritus. Employee count is undated on the Platinum Equity portfolio page (accessed 2026-10-01). Platinum classifies the company as Consumer; sector here follows the business description. Revenue and EBITDA not disclosed; no generic email printed on the company site.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.platinumequity.com/news/platinum-equity-acquires-czarnowski-collective/","name":"Platinum Equity","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-01-19","evidence":"Founded in 1947 and headquartered in Chicago, Czarnowski is a collection of integrated agencies providing end-to-end solutions for trade shows, corporate events, meetings, conferences, and other live experiences."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.czarco.com/about","name":"Czarnowski Collective","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Czarnowski started in Chicago in 1947 as an exhibit house."},"employees":{"url":"https://www.platinumequity.com/our-company/czarnowski-collective/","name":"Platinum Equity","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Headquartered in Chicago, Illinois, Czarnowski Collective has ~1,700 employees"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.platinumequity.com/news/platinum-equity-acquires-czarnowski-collective/","name":"Platinum Equity","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-01-19","evidence":"We like Czarnowski's integrated model and believe its ability to provide a one-stop solution for clients is an important differentiator"},"country":{"url":"https://www.platinumequity.com/our-company/czarnowski-collective/","name":"Platinum Equity","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"2287 S Blue Island Drive Chicago, Illinois 60608"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Platinum Equity","status":"current","status_note":"Acquired from the founding Nagle family in January 2026 (Platinum lists status Active)","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Buyout","value_creation_plan":"Platinum said it sees significant opportunities to enhance Czarnowski's operations and pursue strategic add-on acquisitions, applying its operational expertise and M&A capabilities; management said the partnership will fund new systems and technology, an expanded footprint and deeper creative capabilities.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.platinumequity.com/news/platinum-equity-acquires-czarnowski-collective/","notes":"Family-owned business sale (Platinum portfolio page: 'Private Transaction'). Financial terms not disclosed. Baird advised Czarnowski; Fifth Third advised Platinum."}},{"name":"Oncourse Home Solutions","website":"https://oncourse.com/","description":"Oncourse Home Solutions is a leading national provider of home infrastructure warranties, protecting water, sewer, gas and electric lines, in-home plumbing, and home systems and appliances for more than two million customers across 48 states.","sector":"Financial Services","subsector":"Home warranties and home protection plans","country":"United States","founded_year":1992,"business_model":"B2B2C and B2C (exclusive affinity partnerships with municipalities and utilities plus a direct-to-consumer channel)","email":"customersupport@oncoursehome.com","email_type":"generic","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Aaron Cooper","title":"Chief Executive Officer","source_url":"https://oncourse.com/about-us","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Executive Management Committee | Aaron Cooper | Chief Executive Officer"},{"role":"cfo","name":"Dale R. Gerard","title":"Chief Financial Officer","source_url":"https://oncourse.com/about-us","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Dale R. Gerard | Chief Financial Officer"},{"role":"other","name":"Josh Cohen","title":"Chief Commercial Officer","source_url":"https://oncourse.com/about-us","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Josh Cohen | Chief Commercial Officer"}],"notes":"Formerly American Water Resources / the Homeowner Services Group of American Water; HQ Naperville, Illinois (release dateline). Apax funds agreed in 2021 to buy it from American Water for about $1.275 billion ($480m cash, a $720m seller's note and up to $75m contingent). Genstar signed a definitive agreement to acquire it from Apax funds on 2026-08-19, expected to close in Q4 2026; terms not disclosed. No headcount, revenue or EBITDA disclosed.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.gencap.com/genstar-capital-to-acquire-oncourse-home-solutions-from-apax-funds/","name":"Genstar Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-19","evidence":"Founded in 1992, Oncourse protects the critical home infrastructure that homeowners rely on, including water, sewer, gas, and electric lines, in-home plumbing, and home systems and appliances. The Company serves more than two million customers across 48 states"},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.gencap.com/genstar-capital-to-acquire-oncourse-home-solutions-from-apax-funds/","name":"Genstar Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-19","evidence":"Founded in 1992, Oncourse protects the critical home infrastructure that homeowners rely on"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.gencap.com/genstar-capital-to-acquire-oncourse-home-solutions-from-apax-funds/","name":"Genstar Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-19","evidence":"reaching homeowners through exclusive affinity partnerships and a growing direct-to-consumer channel."},"country":{"url":"https://www.gencap.com/genstar-capital-to-acquire-oncourse-home-solutions-from-apax-funds/","name":"Genstar Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-19","evidence":"NAPERVILLE, Ill., August 19, 2026 —Oncourse Home Solutions (“Oncourse” or “the Company”), a leading national provider of home infrastructure warranties"},"email":{"url":"https://oncourse.com/company/contact-us","name":"Oncourse Home Solutions","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Email support | Email - customersupport@oncoursehome.com"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Genstar Capital","status_note":"Definitive agreement to acquire from Apax funds announced 2026-08-19; expected to close Q4 2026","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","va