 definitive agreement to acquire it from Apax funds on 2026-08-19, expected to close in Q4 2026; terms not disclosed. No headcount, revenue or EBITDA disclosed.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.gencap.com/genstar-capital-to-acquire-oncourse-home-solutions-from-apax-funds/","name":"Genstar Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-19","evidence":"Founded in 1992, Oncourse protects the critical home infrastructure that homeowners rely on, including water, sewer, gas, and electric lines, in-home plumbing, and home systems and appliances. The Company serves more than two million customers across 48 states"},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.gencap.com/genstar-capital-to-acquire-oncourse-home-solutions-from-apax-funds/","name":"Genstar Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-19","evidence":"Founded in 1992, Oncourse protects the critical home infrastructure that homeowners rely on"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.gencap.com/genstar-capital-to-acquire-oncourse-home-solutions-from-apax-funds/","name":"Genstar Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-19","evidence":"reaching homeowners through exclusive affinity partnerships and a growing direct-to-consumer channel."},"country":{"url":"https://www.gencap.com/genstar-capital-to-acquire-oncourse-home-solutions-from-apax-funds/","name":"Genstar Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-19","evidence":"NAPERVILLE, Ill., August 19, 2026 —Oncourse Home Solutions (“Oncourse” or “the Company”), a leading national provider of home infrastructure warranties"},"email":{"url":"https://oncourse.com/company/contact-us","name":"Oncourse Home Solutions","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Email support | Email - customersupport@oncoursehome.com"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Apax","status":"current","status_note":"Carved out of American Water in 2021; agreed in August 2026 to sell to Genstar Capital (closing expected Q4 2026)","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Carve-out","value_creation_plan":"Apax said it would build on the Homeowner Services Group's success, leveraging the Apax Funds' transformational approach, hands-on operational excellence and deep digital expertise; by 2026 it cited turning a utility-owned program into a standalone company with modern technology and claims systems and an investment-grade financing platform.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.apax.com/news-views/american-water-announces-agreement-to-sell-its-homeowner-services-group-to-funds-advised-by-apax-partners/","notes":"Apax portfolio page: investment year 2021, 'formerly American Water Resources'. Deal valued at approximately $1.275 billion including a $720 million seller's note."}},{"name":"Business Network International","website":"https://www.bni.com/","description":"BNI (Business Network International) is the world's largest business networking organization, whose structured referral marketing system lets more than 355,000 Member-businesses in over 11,800 Chapters across 77 countries exchange qualified business referrals.","sector":"Business Services","subsector":"Business referral networking (franchised membership organization)","country":"United States","founded_year":1985,"business_model":"Franchise and membership (B2B: Member-businesses join local Chapters run by franchisees)","email":"support@bni.com","email_type":"generic","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Mary Kennedy Thompson","title":"Chief Executive Officer","source_url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bni-named-to-the-2026-inc-5000-list-of-americas-fastest-growing-private-companies-302846404.html","source_kind":"wire","evidence":"said Mary Kennedy Thompson, CEO of BNI. (CHARLOTTE, N.C., Aug. 11, 2026 /PRNewswire/)"},{"role":"cfo","name":"Andrew Bender","title":"Chief Financial Officer","source_url":"https://www.bni.com/about/leadership/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Executive Leadership Team ... Andrew Bender | Chief Financial Officer"},{"role":"coo","name":"Dave Collins","title":"Chief Operating 