rmation, as relayed by The Next Web, June 2026); these run-rate figures are not recorded as revenue because no filing, company statement or major financial press source states them. Headcount not disclosed ('building toward a team of several hundred').","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/runpod-raises-100m-led-by-summit-partners-to-accelerate-the-ai-developer-cloud-302808689.html","name":"Runpod via PR Newswire","kind":"wire","as_of":"2026-06-24","evidence":"Runpod is the AI Developer Cloud. More than one million developers use Runpod to build, train, fine-tune, deploy, and scale AI on one platform, with self-serve access, transparent per-second pricing, and no commit minimums."},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/runpod-raises-100m-led-by-summit-partners-to-accelerate-the-ai-developer-cloud-302808689.html","name":"Runpod via PR Newswire","kind":"wire","as_of":"2026-06-24","evidence":"With self-serve access, transparent per-second pricing and no commitment minimums, most developers are running their first workload within an hour of sign-up."},"country":{"url":"https://www.runpod.io/about","name":"Runpod","kind":"company","as_of":"2026-09-13","evidence":"We're a remote-first, globally distributed team spanning the U.S., Canada, Europe, and India. While most of us work remotely, we also maintain a presence in San Francisco"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Summit Partners","status":"current","status_note":"Led a $100M growth investment in June 2026 at a $1.0B valuation (Summit lists status Current)","asset_class":"Growth equity","deal_type":"Growth investment","value_creation_plan":"With this funding, Runpod will invest in the platform and developer experience, expand the team across engineering and developer relations, and broaden global access for developers; Summit's Michael Medici joins the board.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/runpod-raises-100m-led-by-summit-part