 not stated."}},{"name":"Waste Eliminator","website":"https://wasteeliminator.com/","description":"Waste Eliminator is a full-service provider of waste collection, storage, removal, hauling, recycling and landfill services to industrial and large commercial businesses and governmental entities across Metro-Atlanta.","sector":"Infrastructure","subsector":"Solid waste collection, recycling and disposal","country":"United States","business_model":"B2B and B2G (commercial, industrial, governmental and residential waste services)","email":"services@wasteeliminator.com","email_type":"generic","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Rich Kang","title":"Chief Executive Officer (combined Waste Eliminator and Liberty Waste Solutions)","source_url":"https://www.tpg.com/news-and-insights/waste-eliminator-and-liberty-waste-solutions-announce-combination-and-appoint-rich-kang-chief-executive-officer","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Waste Eliminator and Liberty Waste Solutions today announced that they will operate under common ownership and a unified leadership team led by newly appointed Chief Executive Officer Rich Kang. (2026-09-10)"},{"role":"other","name":"Kacy Cronan","title":"Senior leader and co-founder (Chief Executive Officer of Waste Eliminator until September 2026)","source_url":"https://www.tpg.com/news-and-insights/waste-eliminator-and-liberty-waste-solutions-announce-combination-and-appoint-rich-kang-chief-executive-officer","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Kang will work closely with Kacy Cronan and Rick Prather, who will continue in senior leadership roles across the combined business"}],"notes":"Corporate headquarters 514 Main St SW, Gainesville, GA (company site; its About page also says 'Headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia'). TPG signed to acquire Waste Eliminator and Liberty Waste Solutions from Allied Industrial Partners on 2026-06-17 and completed the acquisition in August 2026 through TPG Transition Infrastructure; the combined business has 14 permitted faci